      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: "It feels like I\u2019ve seen everything this place has left to see.
        Maybe there\u2019s something Liezel can do now. I should tell her about the
        things I found."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: a27c50b6b538a42eaa4899948f125870, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: "I found some torn newspapers and posters, what looks to be a machine
        to make these\u2026?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
